abstract: >
  Automation Risk Explorer is an AI-driven workforce automation analysis tool that
  generates organizational reports mapping job roles to O*NET occupation codes with
  AI-powered automation and augmentation impact assessments. The system streams real-time
  analysis results - combining O*NET occupation mapping, AI-powered organizational research
  with web search, Anthropic's task analysis data, and adaptive hierarchical organization
  modeling to produce comprehensive workforce impact reports.
